    \end{align}
    for all $i \in [n].$

    For $w = \bar{T} + 1,$ we take $\bar{a}_{w,i} \eqdef 0$ for all $i \neq 1,$ and $\bar{a}_{w,1} \eqdef 1.$

    We choose the following $S:$ 
